# them in any loader. Generated from src/common/signatures.cpp by `emf_sigcheck --export`: do not edit by hand.
# Check them against a game exe without starting the game:
#   emf_sigcheck --patterns emf_signatures.patterns "<game>\enshrouded.exe"
# Each pattern must match exactly once in the exe's .text. `offset=N ; rel32`: the function is the target of the
# call whose rel32 is at match + N. The comment above a line gives each known build's RVA of the function
